WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.176 --> 00:00:02.272
- Hi I'm Hannah, your friendly
neighborhood Wine Mom,

00:00:02.272 --> 00:00:04.247
and a lot of people have
been asking me lately

00:00:04.247 --> 00:00:06.232
what my five-minute beauty routine is,

00:00:06.232 --> 00:00:08.722
to get the way that I look
in the Wine Mom episodes.

00:00:08.722 --> 00:00:09.916
So I figured I should show you,

00:00:09.916 --> 00:00:12.322
because it's very, very
easy, and anybody can do it.

00:00:12.322 --> 00:00:13.420
So let's get started.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.544
The first thing you're gonna want to do

00:00:14.544 --> 00:00:16.585
is pour yourself a tall glass of wine,

00:00:16.585 --> 00:00:17.429
if you're going to be going

00:00:17.429 --> 00:00:20.135
through the effort of doing your make-up.

00:00:20.135 --> 00:00:22.482
Next, tinted moisturizer.

00:00:22.482 --> 00:00:24.909
Those are two words that changed my life.

00:00:24.909 --> 00:00:27.356
It is a really amazing kind of like

00:00:27.356 --> 00:00:30.114
moisturizing cream that makes your skin

00:00:30.114 --> 00:00:32.296
look like it has all its nutrients,

00:00:32.296 --> 00:00:34.631
and that you see the sunlight

00:00:34.631 --> 00:00:36.902
and the light of day regularly.

00:00:36.902 --> 00:00:38.283
You're gonna get a line right here

00:00:38.283 --> 00:00:40.120
if you don't rub it down into your neck.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.338
Next, ever since I had kids,

00:00:42.338 --> 00:00:44.500
all of sudden my skin's
like, Hey, puberty!

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.933
Let's bring these back.

00:00:45.933 --> 00:00:47.887
You're gonna want to get some concealer.

00:00:47.887 --> 00:00:51.692
And I just cake that on, I
don't even bother with blending.

00:00:51.692 --> 00:00:53.857
I'm just like, hey, put a patch on each,

00:00:53.857 --> 00:00:55.825
and figure the rest out.

00:00:55.825 --> 00:00:57.652
Next, winged eyeliner.

00:00:57.652 --> 00:00:59.187
(laughs)

00:00:59.187 --> 00:01:01.237
Moms don't have time for that, forget it.

00:01:01.237 --> 00:01:03.288
We got straight into mascara,
because that's where it's at.

00:01:03.288 --> 00:01:04.302
That's all that really matters.

00:01:04.302 --> 00:01:06.322
If you have your mascara
on, you look put together.

00:01:06.322 --> 00:01:09.115
I invest in a volumizing mascara.

00:01:09.115 --> 00:01:10.952
You want to make sure to
get your bottom lashes,

00:01:10.952 --> 00:01:13.067
because that's gonna open your eyes up.

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:14.686
But the problem I face a lot of the time

00:01:14.686 --> 00:01:16.863
with the bottom lashes, is
I'll start putting it on,

00:01:16.863 --> 00:01:19.228
and then the mascara gets
all over my lower lid.

00:01:19.228 --> 00:01:21.422
Here's a quick, awesome trick.

00:01:21.422 --> 00:01:24.764
Just take your pinky, blend
it into your dark circles.

00:01:24.764 --> 00:01:26.501
And this is gonna just blend right in,

00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:28.205
you're not even gonna
notice that it's there.

00:01:28.205 --> 00:01:29.038
Can you even tell?

00:01:29.038 --> 00:01:29.871
(wine glass rattles)

00:01:29.871 --> 00:01:30.839
Woo!

00:01:30.839 --> 00:01:32.839
I almost dropped my wine.

00:01:32.839 --> 00:01:34.369
Now next, this is
typically where you'd put

00:01:34.369 --> 00:01:35.985
on some blush for a little bit of color,

00:01:35.985 --> 00:01:38.525
but I lost my blush
about three months ago,

00:01:38.525 --> 00:01:39.741
and just never bought anymore.

00:01:39.741 --> 00:01:42.036
So I'm just not doing it any more.

00:01:42.036 --> 00:01:43.292
You're gonna go into into your contour.

00:01:43.292 --> 00:01:47.268
I bought this contouring
kit, that's a concealer kit.

00:01:47.268 --> 00:01:51.090
It comes with this light,
light, light white concealer.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:52.242
And this is key.

00:01:52.242 --> 00:01:53.499
You're gonna take some of this,

00:01:53.499 --> 00:01:55.299
and I mean don't be shy with this,

00:01:55.299 --> 00:01:57.899
you're gonna rub it on
the back of your hand.

00:01:57.899 --> 00:02:00.465
Then you're gonna take
a dark brown eye shadow,

00:02:00.465 --> 00:02:01.947
any shade of dark brown.

00:02:01.947 --> 00:02:04.096
You're gonna dust this all over

00:02:04.096 --> 00:02:06.618
the white contouring concealer.

00:02:06.618 --> 00:02:08.118
You wanna saturate this.

00:02:08.118 --> 00:02:09.143
You're gonna take this,

00:02:09.143 --> 00:02:11.954
and you're just gonna gently
wipe it across your forehead.

00:02:11.954 --> 00:02:13.505
And every mom knows
what I'm talking about,

00:02:13.505 --> 00:02:14.624
where you're like doing something,

00:02:14.624 --> 00:02:16.042
you get something brown on your hand,

00:02:16.042 --> 00:02:17.525
and you wipe your forehead.

00:02:17.525 --> 00:02:19.778
And you don't realize until
it's a few hours later.

00:02:19.778 --> 00:02:21.073
That's what we're going for here.

00:02:21.073 --> 00:02:23.426
This contouring concealer palette

00:02:23.426 --> 00:02:24.889
is actually good for a
lot of different things.

00:02:24.889 --> 00:02:25.800
And the other thing I like to use

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.987
it for is this white concealer,

00:02:27.987 --> 00:02:30.537
I'm just gonna rub a little
bit in between my fingers,

00:02:30.537 --> 00:02:31.667
and get it in my hair.

00:02:31.667 --> 00:02:34.350
And that's kind of like
a white mystery stain,

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:36.538
I don't know if it's puke,

00:02:36.538 --> 00:02:38.552
I don't know if it's butt cream,

00:02:38.552 --> 00:02:40.479
I don't know what it
is, but it's in there.

00:02:40.479 --> 00:02:41.789
And that's like so mom of me.

00:02:41.789 --> 00:02:42.724
It looks great.

00:02:42.724 --> 00:02:44.480
The last piece of make-up
you're really gonna want

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:45.923
is a decent red lipstick.

00:02:45.923 --> 00:02:49.622
And my Mom has told me this
since I was literally born.

00:02:49.622 --> 00:02:51.240
It doesn't matter how you look,

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:52.740
as long as you have a good red lipstick.

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:54.383
So we're gonna get on some red lipstick.

00:02:54.383 --> 00:02:55.847
Oh man.

00:02:55.847 --> 00:02:57.740
If you get a little
residue brown on your face,

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.104
it's like not a big deal either.

00:02:59.104 --> 00:03:00.990
You can just, that's for later.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.795
So that's it, it's very simple.

00:03:02.795 --> 00:03:04.389
So if you have any other mom make-up tips,

00:03:04.389 --> 00:03:05.380
leave it in the comments,

00:03:05.380 --> 00:03:06.630
because I personally don't see

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:08.060
how you can get any better than this.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:10.093
I'm Hannah, your friendly
neighborhood Wine Mom.

00:03:10.093 --> 00:03:11.960
Til next time!

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:14.877
(slow jazzy music)

